  "Roll back DSH adoption…": "回滚 DSH 领养…",
  "Delete is unavailable for an adopted original. Rolling back restores the original DSH bot and its session; remove group roles and resolve new team history first.": "已领养的原 Bot 不能直接删除。回滚后会恢复原 DSH Bot 及其会话；请先移除群组角色并处理新的团队历史。",
  "Remove the Main Bot role before rolling back this adoption.": "回滚此领养前，请先移除主 Bot 角色。",
  "Roll back this adoption? This deletes the Bot record and any settings changed after adoption; the original DSH bot and its session return.": "回滚此领养？这会删除该 Bot 记录及其领养后修改的设置；原 DSH Bot 及其会话将恢复。",
  "Rollback is unavailable until this Bot leaves all groups, is not a Main Bot, and has no tasks or new team history. Delete is also unavailable for an adopted original.": "此 Bot 退出所有群组、不再是主 Bot，且没有任务或新的团队历史之前，无法回滚。已领养的原 Bot 也不能直接删除。",
  "Rolling back removes this Bot and any settings changed after adoption; the original DSH bot and its session return. A confirmation is required.": "回滚会移除该 Bot 及领养后修改的设置；原 DSH Bot 及其会话将恢复。需要确认。",
  "Click again to delete. Its chats are archived.": "再点一次删除，它的对话会归档。",
  "Removes the Bot from the team.": "把这个 Bot 从团队里移除。",
  "Pick a model and {name} can start.": "选好模型，{name} 就能开始工作。",
  "Permissions": "权限",
  "Read only": "仅可查看",
  "Workspace": "工作区内修改",
  "Full access": "完全权限",
  "Auto review": "自动审查",
  "Works as Workspace. Where Workspace would ask you, Codex decides first, with its own reviewer: it runs the step, refuses it, or asks you.": "按工作区内修改运行。需要询问你时，Codex 会先由自己的审查器决定：执行、拒绝或询问你。",
  "Put {name} on Auto?": "让{name}使用自动模式？",
  "Use Auto": "使用自动模式",
  "On Auto, Codex decides by itself, with its own reviewer, which steps it runs, refuses or asks you about. It may change files outside {name}'s folder without asking you, and Automagik does not review those steps.": "在自动模式下，Codex 通过自己的审查器决定执行哪些步骤、拒绝哪些步骤或询问你。它可能不经询问就修改{name}文件夹之外的文件，Automagik 不会审查这些步骤。",
  "Any message that reaches {name}'s chat can lead to such a step: yours, another Bot's or a schedule's. Tasks and Bots it starts from that chat while on Auto start on Auto too.": "任何到达{name}聊天的消息都可能引发这样的步骤：你的消息、其他 Bot 的消息或定时任务的消息。在自动模式下从该聊天启动的任务和 Bot 也以自动模式启动。",
  "This replaces {level}. Based on Codex 0.167.0; a later Codex may decide differently.": "这将替换{level}。基于 Codex 0.167.0；后续版本可能作出不同决定。",
  "Auto counts here: Codex decides on its own.": "自动模式在此生效：Codex 自行决定。",
  "Auto is saved, but here it runs as Workspace: {why}.": "已保存自动模式，但这里按工作区内修改运行：{why}。",
  "this window does not hold the team": "此窗口未持有团队锁",
  "the saved level is not Workspace": "保存的级别不是工作区内修改",
